title: Intro
---
God: man create thing.
God: this will validate his existence.
God: maybe.
God: does he want sea? or desert?
-> sea
    God: show me... sea!
    God: 12 points.
-> desert
    God: did you say sea?
    -> sea
        God: sea it is.
    -> desert
        God: swear I keep hearing sea.
        -> sea
            God: of course!
        -> desert
            God: time will come for desert.
            God: let's start with sea.
<<cutscene sea>>
God: feel the sun on your skin.
God: beautiful.
God: hope it doesn't give you cancer.
God: anyway.
===

title: TVIntro
---
God: TV is allknowing.
God: he loves TV.
God: he wishes he could be more like TV.
God: and for that, the sea needs to go.
<<cutscene land>>
